## if-else

java
if (marks >= 90) {
    System.out.println("A");
} else if (marks >= 75) {
    System.out.println("B");
} else {
    System.out.println("C");
}


## switch

java
switch (op) {
    case '+': result = a + b; break;
    case '-': result = a - b; break;
    default: System.out.println("Invalid");
}

Without break, execution falls through to the next case.

